    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for secondary indexes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Secondary indexes provide fast lookup by non-primary-key fields. They map indexed field values to primary keys. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
